==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|immer||always}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|iomer||always}}. From {{compound|nl|ie|meer|t1=always|t2=more}}. Related to {{m|nl|ieder}}, {{m|nl|iemand}}, {{m|nl|iets}}, {{m|nl|ooit}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|immer}}, {{cog|nds-de|immer}}, {{m|nds-de|ümmer}}, {{m|nds-de|jümmer}}, {{m|nds-de|jümmers}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|nl|Nl-immer.ogg}}
* {{rhyme|nl|ɪmər|s=2}}

===Adverb===
{{nl-adv}}

# {{lb|nl|formal}} [[always]]
#: {{syn|nl|altijd|altoos}}
#: {{ux|nl|Hij is '''immer''' beleefd tegen iedereen.|He is '''always''' polite to everyone.}}
#: {{ux|nl|Het museum is '''immer''' geopend, zelfs op feestdagen.|The museum is open '''always''', even on holidays.}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|nl|immers}}

