==Hunsrik==

===Etymology===
From {{der|hrx|gmh|immer}}, {{m|gmh|iemer}}, {{m|gmh|imer}}, from {{der|hrx|goh|iomer|iomēr|always}}, ultimately from {{der|hrx|gem-pro|*aiwaz|t=long time}} + {{m|gem-pro|*maiz|t=more}}. Related to {{cog|nl|immer}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|hrx|/ˈimɐ/}}

===Adverb===
{{head|hrx|adverb}}

# [[always]]
#: {{ux|hrx|Du machst das '''immer'''.|You '''always''' do that.}}
#: {{ux|hrx|Es is '''immer''' so.|It's '''always''' like this.}}
#: {{ux|hrx|Sie nemmd '''immer''' eere grose Tasch mit.|She '''always''' takes her big purse with her.}}

